  <body><div class="story" id="Epigraph.html" xml:lang="en-US">&#13;
    <p class="Text-indented para-style-override-2"><span class="char-style-override-6">It wasn’t the cold river bottom I felt rushing over me</span></p>&#13;
&#13;
    <p class="Text-indented para-style-override-2"><span class="char-style-override-6">It wasn’t the bitterness of a dream that didn’t come true</span></p>&#13;
&#13;
    <p class="Text-indented para-style-override-2"><span class="char-style-override-6">It wasn’t the wind in the gray fields I felt rushing through my arms</span></p>&#13;
&#13;
    <p class="Text-indented para-style-override-2"><span class="char-style-override-6">No no baby, baby <a id="Anchor-3"/>it was you</span></p>&#13;
&#13;
    <p class="Text-indented para-style-override-6"><span class="char-style-override-7">—</span><span class="char-style-override-8">BRUCE SPRINGSTEEN</span><span class="char-style-override-7">, “Valentine’s Day”</span></p>&#13;
&#13;
